  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ffaff988667590449a4e442eaed46e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: CaveNPCDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueText
  speakerName: Oldar
  paragraphs:
  - Hold there, before you step inside! I am watching this hole. My name is Oldar,
    and I had rather not bury a fool.
  - This is not the mine we knew. The darkness growing down there ain't from coal
    dust. Lately... strange things have been crawling up from the deep.
  - There are treasures hidden in the deep veins, but those beasts are drawn to them
    too. If you find a key, choose carefully where you use it.
  - Do not expect help from me. If the entrance seals up, you're on your own. Now
    go, and mind my warning!
